[00:00.90]Dear Friends,
[00:02.19]I am writing the email to introduce one of the most prestigious Chinese celebrities to you,
[00:10.39]Confucius.
[00:11.46]Being a great thinker,
[00:14.01]educator and founder of Confucianism,
[00:17.57]Confucius is an ancient sage during the Spring and Autumn Period.
[00:23.50]His words and life story were recorded by his disciples and their students inThe Analects.
[00:31.10]As an enduring classic of Chinese ancient culture,
[00:35.10]The Analectshas influenced almost all thinkers,
[00:39.87]writers and politicians in the over-2000-year-long history of China since Confucius.
[00:48.95]Much of Confucian thought on Heaven and Man represents universal human values.
[00:53.18]This is perhaps why Confucian thought in the 21st century still remains 
[00:56.18]the interest of not only the Chinese people but also people in other parts of the world.
[01:02.50]Yours sincerely, Li Ming
